**Agent Identity + Trust — scored, verifiable, portable.**

AID unifies what every other protocol handles separately: identity, trust, payment, and reputation
become a single atomic operation. No facilitator. No signup. No middleman. One HTTP call.

AID = **A**gent **I**dentity **D**ocument — the self-certifying, Ed25519-signed identity that carries
trust scores, attestation history, and Merkle-anchored proofs. Every agent gets one. Every
transaction makes it smarter.

