#### D.3 Signing Input Canonical Form

```cddl
; Canonical signing input (Section A.10)
; Implementations MUST construct this byte string identically

SigningInput = text .cat (
  did "\n"
  providerDid "\n"
  timestamp "\n"
  nonce "\n"
  method SP path "\n"
  bodyHash
)

; WHERE:
;   did         = caller's did:key string
;   providerDid = target server's did:key string
;   timestamp   = ISO 8601 UTC with Z suffix
;   nonce       = 32 hex characters (16 random bytes)
;   method      = HTTP method (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE/PATCH)
;   path        = request path including query string
;   bodyHash    = lowercase hex SHA-256 of raw request body bytes
;                 (64 hex characters for SHA-256)

; The signature is:
;   X-AID-PROOF = base64url(Ed25519Sign(privateKey, SHA-256(SigningInput)))
```

