  Effective cost to game: INFINITE (unforgeable with dual-log system)

DIMENSION 3: volume (weight: 15%)
  Target: min(attestationCount/1000, 1.0) → need 1000 attestations for max score
  Attack: Self-transact 1000 times
  Cost:   1000 × $0.001 = $1.00 (trivially cheap)
  Defense: volume alone only contributes 15% to the score.
           Without diversity (Dimension 5), 1000 self-transactions score:
           volume=1.0 × 15 + successRate=1.0 × 35 + chain=1.0 × 20 +
           manifest=0.5 × 15 + diversity≈0.05 × 15 = 15 + 35 + 20 + 7.5 + 0.75 = 78.25
