  Effective cost: $1 gets you to ~78 (standard), NOT 90+ (proceed)

DIMENSION 4: manifestAdherence (weight: 15%)
  Target: 0.90+
  Attack: Declare minimal manifests, always satisfy them trivially
  Cost:   $0 (just declare what you know you'll do)
